表自己名字的花，或是衣服上绣着花样，胭脂味浓厚，妆容也十分浓，虽然妩媚妖娆，却也香味熏人。所以，她选择自己化妆，熟练的化妆技巧已经化妆常识虽然不知道是从哪里来的，但是，有些时候，轻描淡写更受欢迎。台下的人已经接近疯狂，就差没有跑上来直接掀开步瑶的面纱了。看到这样的场景，步瑶得意的一笑，走到已经准备好的琴面前，优雅的跪坐在榻榻米上，伸出白玉般的柔荑，修长的手指轻轻的拨动着琴弦···琴音悠扬婉转，勾人心弦，台下的人先是好奇，然后都闭上眼睛，细细的听着，就算有一些只顾寻欢作乐者，看着大伙儿都这般表现，也都做做样子闭上眼睛。脑海里想着什么龌蹉之事还不知道呢。步瑶看着这一切，双眸露出得意之色。在场的不过是些凡夫俗子，不是她想要的，但是她相信，她的才气一定会被传出去，然后引来更多的才子贵族，到时候，就是她的世界了。她一直都相信，有男人的地方，就有权位之争，得到那个位高权重者，就等于得到了一切。忘记了过去又怎样？流落烟花之地又如何？只要能得到自己想要的，怎么做都可以。她要的，不仅是活下去，她要高高在上，受万人瞩目的活下去。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/meirenzhiqibutianxia/2.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 2: Willing to Be Bound by Dust and Smoke In this world, there is only what you don’t want and nothing you can’t get. Since you want to get it, you must get it thoroughly. Since you want it, you must get the best. Ice@Fire! Chinese romance time travel book is updated for the first time. If you don’t get it on 151+ Kanshu.com, destroy it. At least, don’t let your opponent get it. \"Miss, everything is ready.\" A girl in green bowed her head respectfully, not daring to raise her head to look at the woman in front of her. The woman inserted an jade hairpin into her hair, put away all the makeup tools, smiled with satisfaction at the delicate smiling face in the mirror, and then stood up. The maid from earlier quickly stepped forward to help him. The woman wears a plum red tube top with a pink wide-sleeved robe as the outer layer. The waist is gathered by a light golden belt, tied with a bow in front of her, and covered with a piece of plain satin. Her hair reached her waist, and her makeup was just right. When she walked to the door, she slowly took out a veil from her waist, covering half of her face, and then signaled the maid to open the door. The woman walked out. The madam didn't seem to expect that the woman would appear in such a half-hidden manner, but the cheers in her ears made her quickly nod with satisfaction. She twisted her fat waist and walked over. She took the woman's hand and narrowed her eyes. Her eyes shouted, \"Masters, this is our newly bloomed flower. Miss Bu Yao wants to meet and say hello to you.\" As soon as the words fell, there was a burst of cheers downstairs, and all the guests on the floor focused their attention on Buyao. Other women always have their faces fully exposed, but this woman has half of her face hidden behind a veil. Is it intentional or is she hiding something? Having said that, because of this translucent veil, Buyao looks like a fairy, mysterious and beautiful. The men's sex has doubled and they can't wait to spend the night with this beauty. Looking at these lustful men, Bu Yao gave a disdainful glance, but the corners of her mouth still rose to a nice curve. Women always like to hear good things. Following the lead of the madam, Bu Yao walked down the stairs step by step. With each step she took, the applause and cheers increased, making her feel proud. She didn't know where she came from, why she was here, and she didn't even know her own name. Today's name was just given by the madam at will. She didn't dislike it, but she liked it. It was only a few days ago that she was so beautiful and gorgeous now. She still remembered that a few days ago, she was still living in hell. It was a dark and damp room, where rats and cockroaches paraded blatantly as if they had been given free privileges. In the corner is a Bu Yao tied to a pillar, in ragged clothes, with long hair covering her face, and her head hanging down weakly, as if she has fainted. Even a mouse ran up to her feet and nibbled her toes without any reaction. This made the mouse even more aggressive, crawling directly along her feet into the broken hem of her skirt, and started having fun. As if she had been tortured too much by a mouse, Bu Yao finally reacted. The haggard face behind her long hair frowned slightly. Bu Yao pulled the corners of her mouth, which caused some of the dried blood to fall off. The mouse in the clothes was still causing trouble. The woman twisted her stiff body and tried to get the mouse out. Unexpectedly, the mouse was quite stubborn and clawed hard at her in the confusion. It sank into Buyao's flesh and blood, causing Buyao to bite her lip, and fresh blood slid down the corners of her mouth. She suddenly raised her head, revealing her entire face. Although all the makeup on her face had faded, it could not hide her delicate little face, which made her look even more pitiable. Bu Yao was trying hard to get rid of the mouse when she suddenly heard footsteps outside. Her originally pale face suddenly turned pale, and she stared at the door in fear. \"Dong\" the door was pushed open by several fierce men, scaring away the mice in the house. \"Hey, the girl is awake.\" A high-pitched voice came from outside the door. Bu Yao didn't need to know who it was. It was the madam who had been trying to torture her these days. As expected, the Madam shook her feather fan and walked in slowly while twisting her thick waist. She probably needed to apply a thousand layers of white flour on her face to make her dark skin so white. But this way she looked more like an old zombie. She specially painted a willow eyebrow and applied purple eye shadow, which was even more terrifying. The madam looked at Bu Yao's haggard face and deliberately slowed down her tone, \"Why are you suffering? Women, only through the body can you survive. You see, if this man is happy, you can survive, not to mention, you are happy too. You are hurting yourself by doing this. , you have to be obedient in the end, think about it carefully, you might as well just accept it. Suffer less, your body can't bear much torture.\" \"Hehe...hehe\" Bu Yao looked at the old bustard, his eyes were full of irony, and his aura instantly increased, making people shudder. Looking at Buyao's smile, the madam knew that Buyao had no intention of surrendering. She had seen countless people, and when a tough woman came to her, who wouldn't give in within three days? But five days have passed, from the day she bought the unconscious girl to now, it has been two months, but Bu Yao made her spend the longest time. Thinking of this, the madam got angry, put her hands on her hips, stared at her small eyes, walked up angrily, and pinched Buyao's chin. She was already impatient. \"Girl, I have said good and bad words countless times, and I have exhausted all methods, but you have not changed at all. Even if you are a Buddha, your patience will disappear. This is the last time. I will give you one day. If you haven't changed your mind, haha, I won't let you even go on stage.\" Bu Yao frowned slightly, looking at the madam's face that became a little twisted because of anger, and found it funny, but she no longer had the strength to laugh. He raised his eyebrows and said, \"Do you think I'm going to be asked to serve these little guys?\"", "title_en": "Chapter 2"}